OL,3,GNEWSASeeing 'lost' kids progress makes
OL,4,Ame most proud
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Some come in looking a bit lost -
OL,7,Fmaybe they don't know where they are in
OL,8,Flife," says Zak Brooks-Sheeley as he
OL,9,Freflects on the work he does at Hull's
OL,10,FTurf Youth Club.
OL,12,F"Just seeing them growing into better
OL,13,Fpeople, it's great to see. You see such
OL,14,Fimprovement here."
OL,16,FThe club at the Goodwin Centre off
OL,17,FAnlaby Road, which is open to young
OL,18,Fpeople aged eight to 19, offers them
OL,19,Fthe use of computers for games and
OL,20,Fhomework, kitchen staff to feed them
OL,21,Fand activities like football, pool,
OL,22,Ftable tennis and arts and crafts.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
